# Sources of the nums-core study (hub 3.1). NUMS.Go files were read at the repository head 9e6bbb4; line ranges sit in the citing claim.

n: 2.4
name: nums-core-sources
kind: hub
is: The primary sources behind hub 3.1: the study report on the NUMS.Go core package, the fifteen Go files of that package with its module file, the workspace file, a design note, the repository's own driver and sample, the pinned tree-sitter Go grammar, the first-round critique, and one Go file and the module file of the http/ tree.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 2.4.1
name: nums-core.md
kind: source
is: The study report on the NUMS.Go core package, 540 lines: what the package represents, how it stores nodes and names, whether it builds and runs, and the experiments the study ran on a scratch copy.
path: coherence-seed/study/r1/nums-core.md
date: 2026-11-24
got: 2026-11-24
at: 2026-11-24

